---
---

<section class="tension section" id="tension">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tension-layout">
      <div class="tension-text">
        <span class="section-label animate-in" data-i18n="tension.label">The Problem</span>
        <h2 class="tension-headline animate-in" data-i18n="tension.title">
          Your fitness app doesn't know you.
        </h2>
        <div class="tension-points animate-in">
          <p data-i18n="tension.p1">
            It doesn't know you slept four hours. It doesn't know you're on day 22 of your cycle. It doesn't know your schedule just changed.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="tension.p2">
            It gives you a rigid plan and expects you to show up the same way every day. When you don't, it counts as failure.
          </p>
          <p class="tension-emphasis" data-i18n="tension.p3">
            Real movement doesn't work like that.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tension-visual animate-in">
        <div class="tension-stats">
          <div class="tension-stat">
            <span class="tension-stat-number">73%</span>
            <span class="tension-stat-label" data-i18n="tension.stat1">of women quit fitness apps within 3 months</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tension-stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="tension-stat">
            <span class="tension-stat-number">1 in 4</span>
            <span class="tension-stat-label" data-i18n="tension.stat2">say the plan didn't fit their daily life</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tension-stat-divider"></div>
          <div class="tension-stat">
            <span class="tension-stat-number">0</span>
            <span class="tension-stat-label" data-i18n="tension.stat3">major apps adapt to cycle, sleep, and energy together</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tension {
    background: var(--ivory);
    position: relative;
  }

  .tension-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tension-headline {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .tension-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .tension-points p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .tension-emphasis {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy) !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem) !important;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  /* ─── Stats block ─── */
  .tension-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .tension-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--navy-deep);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    max-width: 360px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .tension-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .tension-stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .tension-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-inverse-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 260px;
  }

  .tension-stat-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ─── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tension-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .tension-headline {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .tension-stats {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
